<title>USA: Red Roof Inns Inc Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Red Roof Inns Inc Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>HILLIARD, Ohio 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Operating Results</p>
<p>		  (in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>			     Third Quarter Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>			   Sep 28,   Sep 30,     Sep 28,    Sep 30,</p>
<p>				1996	1995	 1996	 1995</p>
<p> Revenues		$92,535   $84,513    $244,400   $223,047</p>
<p> Operating income     33,563    30,780	71,760     63,528</p>
<p> Net income	     14,029    10,927	24,105     15,119</p>
<p>Pro forma</p>
<p>Comparisons:</p>
<p> Net income	     14,029    12,245	25,160     20,844</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>shares outstanding</p>
<p>			    28,332    28,660	28,525     28,660</p>
<p> Earnings per share	.50	 .43	   .88	  .73</p>
<p>NOTE: The 1995 results include third-quarter and nine-months non-recurring charges of $58,000 and $2,885,000 respectively, relating to a change in management.</p>
<p>1996 nine-month results include a non-recurring charge of $450,000 to recognize impairment of certain long-lived assets.</p>
<p>The per-share figures are pro forma to give effect to the offering of 10,000 shares of common stock on January 31, 1996, and the application of a portion of the net proceeds to reduce mortgage indebtedness and related interest expense, and to exclude the non-recurring charges.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
